<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-07T23:49:16.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 23:49:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli President has appointed former general Gadi Eisenkot, a rival of Prime Minister Netanyahu, to try to form a new government, intensifying coalition talks. Heavy rains have flooded tens of thousands of displacement tents in Gaza, damaging structures already weakened by bombings, while gunfire struck tents at the Rafah site as aid teams prepare for winter storms. Israeli settlers seized eight Palestinian homes in Jericho, displacing dozens of residents. The United Nations reported 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/07/israel-president-gadi-eisenkot-form-government&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168740&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/07/world/middleeast/israel-eisenkot-government.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQVHIwVVZqTlgycHFJTEhPM3g1WU5oWWtKelZsNW5aUEphdmpDRC1STjMxQmYyYjR5dkNZUVFiVFBfZ3J1Nm9HN0RmM25pOUlTMWJkWGZuVktLV3h5QkNmdEtrbUt5X2NBYXFuZC04TzhPZUJWLWVJeWJMM256ZWIxRENRczhNdEtIa2I2aF85VzJUejZMa1ZvVEFSZXZCQWJtZU1nTnBvaVl4cmNJTEhfcWpCNTFjMmotS090TzE1eXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmy8367lj5xlo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/07/israeli-president-taps-ex-general-eisenkot-opponent-netanyahu-form-government/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/07/world/middleeast/eisenkot-israel-new-government.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https